@startuml
title Compose / Deployment View (DEV)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
left to right direction

node "Docker Host" as Host {
  frame "docker compose project network" as Net {

    rectangle "fake-serial\n(simulator)\nTCP :7000\nhealthcheck: nc -z :7000" as Fake

    rectangle "qr-c\n(C++)\nREST :8080\nhealthcheck: GET /health\n\n- entrypoint starts socat\n- app reads PTY /tmp/ttyS1" as QRC

    rectangle "api-test\n(pytest)\nprofile: test\ncalls qr-c REST" as APIT

    rectangle "contract-test\n(schemathesis)\nprofile: test\nOpenAPI from ./docs\ncalls qr-c REST" as CT
  }

  folder "./docs\n(openapi.yaml)" as Docs
  folder "./logs\n(optional)" as Logs
}

Fake --> QRC : TCP stream\nfake-serial:7000\n(COBS frames)
APIT --> QRC : REST\nhttp://qr-c:8080
CT --> QRC : REST\nhttp://qr-c:8080

Docs ..> CT : volume mount\n/spec/openapi.yaml (ro)
Logs ..> QRC : volume mount\n/var/log/qr-c (optional)

note right of QRC
Serial is emulated as:
TCP -> socat -> local PTY

PTY must be created in qr-c container.
end note

@enduml
